<title>AUSTRIA: PERLMOOSER SUSPENDED FROM VIENNA BOURSE.</title>
<headline>PERLMOOSER SUSPENDED FROM VIENNA BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Austrian cement works Perlmooser AG will be suspended from Vienna bourse trade from August 8 to 14 due to preparation of a buy-back offer to shareholders, the bourse said on Friday.</p>
<p>Last month Bank Austria said it had sold its remaining 12 percent stake in Perlmooser to France's Lafarge for an undisclosed sum. Lafarge already held 75 percent of the company.</p>
<p>Perlmooser said a buy-back offer, to be announced on August 14, would be made to the remaining small shareholders. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
